{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方最大、最亮的主标题「舍不得被当作自己人的日子」，随后注意到下方同样醒目的小标题「一阵心慌」。右上角目录和下方音符动画属于次要视觉入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不确定。只能隐约抓到与一段曾被当作自己人的日子有关，具体此刻遭遇了什么并不明确。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心慌。\",\n  \"missed\": \"那扇门再次出现，却不再像最初那样召唤；重新遇见过去那个不知所措的自己；这一次已经知道过去的自己经历过什么，但问题仍没有简单答案。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"主标题表达的处境比较抽象，单独扫过难以判断具体发生了什么。\",\n    \"核心信息分散在主标题和小标题中，需要把两块拼接才能得到处境与感受。\",\n    \"正文连续堆叠多行，真正解释当前处境的内容需要进一步阅读才能获得。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c6015640-a679-4dc8-a50b-3378755a1f98", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T022344126538Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:24:11.190148+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "038ff311ae9e48dfb649273d1cb74e2607bb512f1e71be0f48a1160417c2058b", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb